Package: odoo-erpnet-fp
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Rosen Vladimirov <vladimirov.rosen@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), docker.io | docker-ce, ca-certificates, debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0
Recommends: openssh-server
Homepage: https://github.com/rosenvladimirov/Odoo.ErpNet.FP
Description: Odoo.ErpNet.FP fiscal printer proxy (Docker) with its own remote access tunnel
 Runs the Odoo.ErpNet.FP proxy (ErpNet.FP-compatible HTTP API for Bulgarian
 fiscal devices, pinpads, scales) as a Docker container under systemd, and
 optionally connects this machine to its own private Cloudflare tunnel from an
 EFP1. enrollment code. Nothing is published, no firewall port is opened, and
 another cloudflared installation on the machine is not touched.
